# Mutation cases for the integration drivers' fixture citations — the
# document a driver's header names is a document that is there.
#
# Run with
# `scripts/mutate sce-build/tests/mutations/driver_fixture_citation.cases`.
#
# The case below restores the exact text that was in the tree until
# 2026-08-13. `backends/rust/tests/fixtures/` was never a real directory —
# the canonical documents live under `integration_resources/<stem>/` — and
# the sentence had been wrong long enough to be corrected once already, in
# `src/integration/mod.rs`, while this second copy survived. That is the
# ordinary outcome of fixing a duplicated claim by hand.
#
# Nothing else in the repository could see it. Comments are not compiled, so
# no build, no clippy pass and no test read that line. Measured before the
# gate landed: 89 fixture citations across the drivers, one of them broken,
# and every suite green.
#
# A case that SURVIVES here means the gate is decorative.

mutation_tests -p sce-build --features cli --test integration_stem_registration

# `mutation_runtime_targets`, not `mutation_targets`: the gate READS this
# driver at run time rather than compiling it. Declared as a compiled
# target the case is INCONCLUSIVE by definition — the `sce-build` test
# binary cannot change when a file in `backends/rust/tests/` does, and the
# harness says so rather than reporting a false CAUGHT. Measured here
# first, which is the harness catching the casefile's own mistake.
mutation_runtime_targets backends/rust/tests/tests/donedata_local_invoke.rs

# ── A driver points at a directory that does not exist ─────────────
#
# The reader who wants to edit this machine is sent to
# `backends/rust/tests/fixtures/`, finds nothing, and has to grep the tree
# for the stem to discover where the document actually lives. The failure is
# entirely in what a person is told; the run itself is unaffected, which is
# why only a gate that reads the prose can report it.

mutation_case "a driver cites a fixture directory that was never real" <<'PY'
edit("backends/rust/tests/tests/donedata_local_invoke.rs",
     "// Fixture: integration_resources/donedata_local_invoke/donedata_local_invoke.scxml",
     "// Fixture: backends/rust/tests/fixtures/donedata_local_invoke.scxml")
PY
